  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Corn Dog.png|200px|left|Corn dog]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 78\n |price = 1 to 529\n |time = 1 h\n |source = {{Infoicon|hotdogs|bigger|link=Hot Dog Stand}}\n |xp = 63\n |base = 147\n |dia = 4\n |time3 = 51 min\n}}\n'''Corn dogs''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 78.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making corn dogs'''===\n[[File:Hot Dog Stand.png|150px|left|Hot dog stand]]\nCorn dogs are made in the [[Hot Dog Stand]].\n\nTo make a corn dog, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Bacon.png|75px|Bacon|link=Bacon]]\n|[[File:Corn.png|75px|Corn|link=Corn]]\n|[[File:Olive Oil.png|75px|Olive oil|link=Olive Oil]]\n|-\n|'''x4'''\n|'''x4'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour to make one corn dog, and 51 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] stand. Each dog gives players 63 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling corn dogs'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Corn dogs can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 5,292 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 dogs.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a corn dog costs 505 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 corn dog per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n=== '''Strategy tips''' ===\n* Corn dogs are very hard to find in the [[Daily Dirt]].\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Corndog\n|es = Perrito de maíz\n|fr = Saucisse sur bâtonnet\n|it = Corn dog\n|nl = Gefrituurde Hotdog\n|no = Maispølse\n|ru = Кукурузный хот-дог\n|zh = Corn Dog\n}}\n[[pt-br:Salsicha no palito]]\n\n[[Category:Hot Dog Stand Products]]\n[[Category:Corn Products]]\n[[Category:Bacon Products]]\n[[Category:Olive Oil Products]]",
